
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.Log10(Value: number): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float llLog10(float Value);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use math.log10 because Double precision; fastcall.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is the base 10 [](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Wikipedia-16px.png)&#8201;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/logarithm" target="_blank">logarithm</a> of <b>val</b>.</p>
  <p>If <b>val</b> <= 0 return zero instead.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Value / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/val" target="_blank">val</a></td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>math</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">264</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-pure">Side-Effect Free</span>
        <span class="attr-label bg-native">Native Coded</span>
        <span class="lua-section attr-label bg-deprecated">Lua Deprecated</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>To get the [](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Wikipedia-16px.png)&#8201;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/natural_logarithm" target="_blank">natural logarithm</a> use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlLog" target="_blank">llLog</a>.</p>
  <p>llLog10 should only be used where the base 10 log is needed, all other applications should use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlLog" target="_blank">llLog</a> instead.</p>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function main()
    local num1 = ll.Frand(100.0)

    ll.OwnerSay("The base 10 logarithm of " .. tostring(num1) .. " is " .. tostring(ll.Log10(num1)))
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
  state_entry()
  {
    float num1 = llFrand(100.0);

    llOwnerSay("The base 10 logarithm of " + (string)num1 + " is " + (string)llLog10(num1));
  }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <p>There are only two log functions <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlLog" target="_blank">llLog</a> and llLog10. Errors introduced as a result of floating-point arithmetic are most noticable when working with logarithms. <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlLog" target="_blank">llLog</a> should be used instead of llLog10 when converting the base of the logarithm.</p>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local LogBaseN = ll.Log(value) / ll.Log(Base)  --This technique introduces errors but is the only way`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float LogBaseN = llLog(value) / llLog(Base); //This technique introduces errors but is the only way`} lang="lsl" /></div>
